      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ازلج السَّهْمَ</span></b>  <i>He made the arrow to fall upon
the ground, and not to go straight to the animal
at which it was shot.</i> (TA. [See also 4 in art.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زلخ</span>.]) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ازلج البَابَ</span> <i>He closed,</i> or <i>made fast, the
door with the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِزْلَاج</span> [q. v.]; (S, * K;) as also
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَلَجَهُ</span></b> , (K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَلْجٌ</span>. (TA. [See, again, 4
in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زلج</span>.])

